00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:59.230
And my lemonade business, you know

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:01.590
I learned how to manage kids.

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:02.570
I mean this is just real now,

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:03.950
