00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.800
I learned how to motivate my friends,

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:10.980
AKA manipulate and trick them
into standing behind a table

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:13.610
for six hours in the
summer to sell lemonade.

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:15.340
But I learned what the power of marketing

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.310
and branding intention.

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:18.530
I literally, this is
crazy to me in hindsight.

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:21.050
